# baseball-sheet-refresh

GitHub Actions + R + baseballR + Google Sheets.

## Required GitHub secrets
- GOOGLE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_JSON
- GOOGLE_SHEET_ID

## Required Google Sheet tabs
- test
- asset_database
- Free Agent Helper
- raw_milb_pitchers
- raw_milb_hitters
- raw_pitchers
- raw_hitters
- asset_scores
- free_agent_rankings
- last_update

## Apps Script setup
In the Google Sheet:
1. Extensions -> Apps Script
2. Paste `apps_script/Code.gs`
3. In Project Settings -> Script Properties add:
   - GITHUB_OWNER = deanrillo123-lgtm
   - GITHUB_REPO = baseball-sheet-refresh
   - GITHUB_WORKFLOW_FILE = baseball-sheet-refresh.yml
   - GITHUB_BRANCH = main
   - GITHUB_TOKEN = your GitHub PAT with permission to dispatch workflow runs

## Notes
- Season-long stats use the previous season until April 1, then switch to the current season.
- Some MiLB advanced metrics may be `NA` due to source coverage limitations.
